content:
An installment paid ahead with an initial payment on a new fee-bearing TRICARE Prime enrollment is valued by the frequency of the installment charge whose coverage period begins latest:

- **monthly** - one twelfth of the annual fee of the enrollment's fee arrangement (divided by 12), rounded to the cent;
- **quarterly** - one quarter of it (divided by 4), rounded to the cent;
- **otherwise** - the whole annual fee.

**Hypothetical.** On a TRICARE Prime Retiree Group B family arrangement (969.36) whose latest-beginning charge is quarterly, an installment paid ahead is valued at 242.34; two paid ahead come to 484.68.
